function exportGradebookCsv(){const c=$('#gradebookClass')?.value||'',sub=$('#gradebookSubject')?.value||'';if(!c)return toast('Choisis une classe');const es=gradebookEvaluations(c,sub),ss=db.students.filter(s=>s.classId===c),rows=[['Élève',...es.map(e=>`${e.title} (coef ${e.coefficient||1})`),'Moyenne']];ss.forEach(s=>rows.push([`${s.last.toUpperCase()} ${s.first}`,...es.map(e=>e.grades?.find(g=>g.studentId===s.id)?.value??''),weightedAverageForEvaluations(es,[s.id])]));downloadText('export-carnet.csv',rows.map(r=>r.map(v=>`"${String(v).replaceAll('"','""')}"`).join(';')).join('\n'),'text/csv;charset=utf-8');toast('Carnet exporté')}
function exportAttendanceCsv(){const rows=[['Date','Classe','Créneau','Élève','État','Justifiée','Motif']];for(const a of db.attendance)for(const r of a.rows||[]){const s=student(r.studentId);rows.push([a.date,cls(a.classId)?.name||'',attendanceSlotLabel(a),s?`${s.last.toUpperCase()} ${s.first}`:'',r.status,r.justified?'Oui':'Non',r.reason||''])}downloadText('export-appels.csv',rows.map(r=>r.map(v=>`"${String(v).replaceAll('"','""')}"`).join(';')).join('\n'),'text/csv;charset=utf-8');toast('Appels exportés')}
function downloadText(name,text,type='text/plain;charset=utf-8'){const a=document.createElement('a');a.href=URL.createObjectURL(new Blob([text],{type}));a.download=name;document.body.appendChild(a);a.click();a.remove();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(a.href),1000)}
function v102WorkTracking(){return db.lessons.filter(l=>l.homework?.requiresSubmission&&l.homework?.due).sort((a,b)=>a.homework.due.localeCompare(b.homework.due)).slice(0,8).map(l=>{const ss=db.students.filter(s=>s.classId===l.classId&&(!l.group||s.group===l.group));const received=new Set(db.submissions.filter(x=>x.lessonId===l.id).map(x=>x.studentId));return {l,expected:ss.length,received:received.size,missing:ss.filter(s=>!received.has(s.id))}})}
function toggleSubmissionCorrected(id){const x=db.submissions.find(s=>s.id===id);if(!x)return;x.corrected=!x.corrected;x.correctedAt=x.corrected?new Date().toISOString():'';save();const l=db.lessons.find(z=>z.id===x.lessonId);if(l)openWorkTracking(l.id)}
function openWorkTracking(id){const l=db.lessons.find(x=>x.id===id);if(!l)return;const ss=db.students.filter(s=>s.classId===l.classId&&(!l.group||s.group===l.group)).sort((a,b)=>(a.last||'').localeCompare(b.last||'','fr',{sensitivity:'base'})||(a.first||'').localeCompare(b.first||'','fr',{sensitivity:'base'})),subs=db.submissions.filter(x=>x.lessonId===id&&x.status!=='draft'),received=new Set(subs.map(x=>x.studentId)),corrected=subs.filter(x=>x.corrected).length;openModal(`Suivi — ${esc(l.homework?.title||'Travail')}`,`<div class="miniKpis"><div class="miniKpi"><small>À rendre</small><b>${ss.length}</b></div><div class="miniKpi"><small>Reçus</small><b>${received.size}</b></div><div class="miniKpi"><small>À corriger</small><b>${Math.max(0,subs.length-corrected)}</b></div><div class="miniKpi"><small>Échéance</small><b>${fmtDate(l.homework.due)}</b></div></div><div class="tablewrap section"><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>Élève</th><th>Rendu</th><th>Correction</th></tr></thead><tbody>${ss.map(s=>{const sub=subs.find(x=>x.studentId===s.id);return `<tr><td><b>${esc(s.last.toUpperCase())} ${esc(s.first)}</b></td><td>${sub?`<div>${submissionFiles(sub).map(f=>`<a href="${esc(f.url)}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">${esc(f.name)}</a>`).join('<br>')}</div>`:'<span class="pill orange">Non rendu</span>'}</td><td>${sub?`<button class="btn small" onclick="openSubmissionCorrection('${sub.id}')">${sub.corrected?'Modifier la correction':'Corriger'}</button>`:'—'}</td></tr>`}).join('')}</tbody></table></div><div class="modalfoot">${l.homework?.linkedEvaluation?`<button class="btn" onclick="openEvaluation('${typeof l.homework.linkedEvaluation==='object'?l.homework.linkedEvaluation.id:l.homework.linkedEvaluation}')">Saisir les notes</button>`:''}<button class="btn primary" onclick="closeModal()">Fermer</button></div>`)}
function renderCommand(){const q=($('#v12CommandInput')?.value||'').trim().toLowerCase(),box=$('#v12CommandList');if(!box)return;const groups=v12CommandItems().map(g=>({...g,items:g.items.filter(x=>!q||(x.title+' '+x.meta).toLowerCase().includes(q))})).filter(g=>g.items.length);box.innerHTML=groups.length?groups.map(g=>`<div class="v12CommandGroup"><div class="v12CommandGroupTitle">${esc(g.group)}</div>${g.items.map((x,i)=>`<button class="v12CommandItem" onclick="${x.action}"><span class="v12CommandIcon">${x.icon}</span><span><b>${esc(x.title)}</b><small>${esc(x.meta)}</small></span></button>`).join('')}</div>`).join(''):`<div class="v12CommandEmpty">Aucune action ne correspond à « ${esc(q)} ».</div>`;box.querySelector('.v12CommandItem')?.classList.add('selected')}

// V17.3 stability guards: keep legacy navigation/search entry points defined.
function v125GlobalSearch(q){return globalSearch(q)}
function closeLocalSelects(){document.querySelectorAll('.localSelect.open').forEach(x=>x.classList.remove('open'))}
function closeCommand(){const x=document.getElementById('v12Command');if(x)x.classList.remove('open')}
function v12CommandItems(){return [{group:'Navigation',items:NAV.map(n=>({icon:n[1],title:n[2],meta:'Ouvrir le module',action:`go('${n[0]}')`}))}]} 
function openCommand(){let x=document.getElementById('v12Command');if(!x){x=document.createElement('div');x.id='v12Command';x.className='v12Command';x.innerHTML='<div class="v12CommandPanel"><div class="v12CommandSearch"><input id="v12CommandInput" class="input" placeholder="Rechercher une action…" oninput="renderCommand()"><kbd>Esc</kbd></div><div id="v12CommandList"></div></div>';document.body.appendChild(x);x.addEventListener('click',e=>{if(e.target===x)closeCommand()})}x.classList.add('open');renderCommand();setTimeout(()=>document.getElementById('v12CommandInput')?.focus(),0)}
function openMessage(id,classId){openTeacherConversationComposer();}


function focusGlobalSearch(){const x=document.querySelector('.searchGlobal');if(x){x.focus();x.select?.();return true}return false}
document.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(e.key==='Escape'){closeLocalSelects();closeModal();closeCommand();closeGlobalSearch()}if((e.metaKey||e.ctrlKey)&&e.key.toLowerCase()==='k'){e.preventDefault();focusGlobalSearch()}});load();
initSidebar();


function courseIdentity(s){return [s.classId,s.subject,s.teacherId||'',s.group||''].join('|')}
function openCourseManager(){const map=new Map();db.schedule.forEach(s=>{const key=courseIdentity(s);if(!map.has(key))map.set(key,{key,classId:s.classId,subject:s.subject||'',teacherId:s.teacherId||'',group:s.group||'',color:s.color||subjectColor(s.subject)[2],pattern:s.pattern||'none',slots:[]});map.get(key).slots.push(s)});const courses=[...map.values()].sort((a,b)=>(cls(a.classId)?.name||'').localeCompare(cls(b.classId)?.name||'','fr')||a.subject.localeCompare(b.subject,'fr'));window.courseManagerKeys=courses.map(c=>c.key);openModal('Gérer les cours',`<div class="notice">Un cours regroupe ses créneaux habituels. Modifier son intitulé ou sa couleur s’applique à tous ses créneaux. Un remplacement de professeur ou une annulation ponctuelle se gère dans les exceptions du créneau concerné.</div><div class="section">${courses.map((c,i)=>`<form class="courseManagerRow" onsubmit="saveCourseMeta(event,${i})"><div class="courseColor"><input type="color" name="color" value="${esc(c.color)}" aria-label="Couleur du cours"><select class="select" name="pattern" aria-label="Hachures" style="max-width:110px"><option value="none" ${c.pattern==='none'?'selected':''}>Sans hachures</option><option value="hatch" ${c.pattern==='hatch'?'selected':''}>Diagonales</option><option value="cross" ${c.pattern==='cross'?'selected':''}>Croisées</option></select></div><div class="courseManagerFields"><small>${c.slots.length} créneau(x) lié(s)</small><select class="select" name="classId" aria-label="Classe du cours" required>${db.classes.map(clx=>`<option value="${clx.id}" ${String(c.classId)===String(clx.id)?'selected':''}>${esc(clx.name)}</option>`).join('')}</select><input class="input" name="subject" value="${esc(c.subject)}" aria-label="Intitulé du cours" required><select class="select" name="teacherId"><option value="">Professeur titulaire non précisé</option>${db.teachers.filter(t=>t.active!==false).map(t=>`<option value="${t.id}" ${String(c.teacherId)===String(t.id)?'selected':''}>${esc(teacherName(t))}</option>`).join('')}</select><input class="input" name="group" value="${esc(c.group)}" aria-label="Sous-groupe" placeholder="Sous-groupe (facultatif)"></div><button class="btn small primary">Appliquer</button></form>`).join('')||'<div class="empty">Aucun cours enregistré.</div>'}</div><div class="modalfoot"><button class="btn" onclick="closeModal()">Fermer</button></div>`)}
function saveCourseMeta(ev,index){ev.preventDefault();const key=(window.courseManagerKeys||[])[index],f=ev.target,o=Object.fromEntries(new FormData(f)),slots=db.schedule.filter(s=>courseIdentity(s)===key);if(!slots.length)return toast('Cours introuvable.');const subject=String(o.subject||'').trim();if(!subject)return toast('Indiquez un intitulé.');const classId=String(o.classId||slots[0].classId),teacherId=String(o.teacherId||''),group=String(o.group||'').trim(),nextKey=[classId,subject,teacherId,group].join('|');slots.forEach(s=>{s.classId=classId;s.subject=subject;s.teacherId=teacherId;s.group=group;s.color=o.color;s.pattern=o.pattern||'none';s.courseId=nextKey});save();closeModal();render();openCourseManager();toast('Tous les créneaux du cours ont été mis à jour')}

/* V20.2 — outils visibles, notifications, Drive moderne et exceptions EDT */
function notifications(){return activity()}
function cloudFileVisual(x){if(x.type==='folder')return '<svg viewBox="0 0 48 40" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 10a4 4 0 0 1 4-4h11l5 5h16a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v16a4 4 0 0 1-4 4H8a4 4 0 0 1-4-4z" fill="#eaf2ff" stroke="#8fb2ee" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M4 16h40" stroke="#8fb2ee" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg>';const name=String(x.name||''),ext=(name.split('.').pop()||'').toLowerCase(),mime=String(x.mime||'').toLowerCase();if(mime.startsWith('image/')||/\.(png|jpe?g|gif|webp|avif|bmp)$/.test(name.toLowerCase()))return x.url?`<img class="cloudThumb" src="${esc(x.url)}" alt="" loading="lazy" onerror="this.style.display='none';this.nextElementSibling.style.display='grid'"><span class="fileType fallback" style="display:none">IMG</span>`:'<span class="fileType">IMG</span>';if(mime.startsWith('video/')||/\.(mp4|mov|webm|m4v|avi)$/.test(name.toLowerCase()))return x.url?`<video class="cloudThumb" src="${esc(x.url)}" muted preload="metadata" playsinline onloadedmetadata="try{this.currentTime=Math.min(.1,this.duration||.1)}catch(e){}" onerror="this.style.display='none';this.nextElementSibling.style.display='grid'"></video><span class="fileType video fallback" style="display:none">▶</span>`:'<span class="fileType video">▶</span>';const types={pdf:['PDF','pdf'],doc:['W','word'],docx:['W','word'],odt:['LO','libre'],rtf:['RTF','word'],txt:['TXT','text'],md:['MD','text'],csv:['XLS','sheet'],xls:['XLS','sheet'],xlsx:['XLS','sheet'],ods:['LO','libre'],ppt:['P','slide'],pptx:['P','slide'],odp:['LO','libre'],zip:['ZIP','archive'],mp3:['♪','audio'],wav:['♪','audio'],m4a:['♪','audio'],aac:['♪','audio'],flac:['♪','audio'],ogg:['♪','audio'],mov:['▶','video'],webm:['▶','video'],avi:['▶','video']};const t=types[ext]||['FICH','generic'];return `<span class="fileType ${t[1]}">${t[0]}</span>`}
function cloudSelect(id,ev){window.cloudSelectedIds=Array.isArray(window.cloudSelectedIds)?window.cloudSelectedIds:[];if(ev&&(ev.ctrlKey||ev.metaKey||ev.shiftKey)){if(!window.cloudSelectedIds.includes(id))window.cloudSelectedIds.push(id);else window.cloudSelectedIds=window.cloudSelectedIds.filter(x=>x!==id)}else window.cloudSelectedIds=[id];window.cloudSelected=window.cloudSelectedIds.includes(id)?id:(window.cloudSelectedIds[0]||'');document.querySelectorAll('.cloudItem,.cloudListRow').forEach(el=>el.classList.toggle('selected',window.cloudSelectedIds.includes(el.dataset.cloudId)));refreshCloudContextActions();}
function cloudContextActionMarkup(){const n=(window.cloudSelectedIds||[]).length;if(n>1)return `<button class="btn small" onclick="cloudMoveSelected()">Déplacer la sélection</button><button class="btn small danger" onclick="cloudDeleteSelected()">Supprimer la sélection</button>`;if(window.cloudSelected)return `<button class="btn small" onclick="cloudPreview(window.cloudSelected)">Aperçu</button><button class="btn small" onclick="cloudInfo(window.cloudSelected)">Infos</button><button class="btn small" onclick="cloudShare()">Partager</button><button class="btn small" onclick="cloudCopyLink()">Lien</button><button class="btn small" onclick="cloudCopy()">Copier</button><button class="btn small" onclick="cloudRename()">Renommer</button><button class="btn small" onclick="cloudMoveSelected()">Déplacer</button><button class="btn small danger" onclick="cloudDelete()">Supprimer</button>`;return `<button class="btn small" onclick="cloudSelectAll()">Tout sélectionner</button>`}
function refreshCloudContextActions(){const el=document.getElementById('cloudContextActions');if(el)el.innerHTML=cloudContextActionMarkup()}
function cloudSelectAll(){const role=appSpace==='student'?'student':'teacher',sid=role==='student'?activeStudent():'',items=cloudCurrentItems(role,sid);window.cloudSelectedIds=items.map(x=>x.id);window.cloudSelected=window.cloudSelectedIds[0]||'';document.querySelectorAll('.cloudItem,.cloudListRow').forEach(el=>el.classList.toggle('selected',window.cloudSelectedIds.includes(el.dataset.cloudId)));refreshCloudContextActions();toast(`${window.cloudSelectedIds.length} élément(s) sélectionné(s)`)}
function cloudItemMenu(ev,id){ev.preventDefault();window.cloudSelected=id;openModal('Actions sur « '+esc(db.cloudItems.find(x=>x.id===id)?.name||'élément')+' »',`<div class="toolbar">${[['Ouvrir','cloudOpen'],['Aperçu','cloudPreview'],['Partager','cloudShare'],['Déplacer','cloudMoveSelected'],['Renommer','cloudRename'],['Infos','cloudInfo']].map(([label,fn])=>`<button class="btn" onclick="closeModal();${fn}('${id}')">${label}</button>`).join('')}</div><div class="modalfoot"><button class="btn" onclick="closeModal()">Fermer</button></div>`)}
function cloudMoveSelected(){const ids=(window.cloudSelectedIds||[]).filter(id=>db.cloudItems.some(x=>x.id===id));if(!ids.length&&window.cloudSelected)ids.push(window.cloudSelected);if(!ids.length)return toast('Sélectionnez un ou plusieurs éléments.');const role=appSpace==='student'?'student':'teacher',sid=role==='student'?activeStudent():'';if(ids.some(id=>!cloudCanWrite(role,sid,db.cloudItems.find(x=>x.id===id))))return toast('Certains éléments ne peuvent pas être déplacés.');openModal('Déplacer la sélection',`<div class="field"><label>Dossier de destination</label><select class="select" id="cloudBulkDest"><option value="">Racine</option>${cloudAccessible(role,sid).filter(q=>q.type==='folder'&&!ids.includes(q.id)).map(f=>`<option value="${f.id}">${esc(f.name)}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><div class="notice section">${ids.length} élément(s) seront déplacés.</div><div class="modalfoot"><button class="btn" onclick="closeModal()">Annuler</button><button class="btn primary" onclick="cloudMoveMany()">Déplacer</button></div>`)}
async function cloudMoveMany(){const ids=[...(window.cloudSelectedIds||[])],dest=$('#cloudBulkDest')?.value||null;closeModal();let ok=0;for(const id of ids){try{await cloudMove(id,dest);ok++}catch(e){console.error(e)}}window.cloudSelectedIds=[];window.cloudSelected='';render();toast(`${ok}/${ids.length} élément(s) déplacé(s)`)}
function cloudDeleteSelected(){let ids=(window.cloudSelectedIds||[]).filter(id=>db.cloudItems.some(x=>x.id===id));if(!ids.length&&window.cloudSelected)ids=[window.cloudSelected];if(!ids.length)return toast('Sélectionnez un ou plusieurs éléments.');const role=appSpace==='student'?'student':'teacher',sid=role==='student'?activeStudent():'';if(ids.some(id=>!cloudCanWrite(role,sid,db.cloudItems.find(x=>x.id===id))))return toast('Certains éléments ne peuvent pas être supprimés.');confirmModal(`Supprimer ${ids.length} élément(s) sélectionné(s) et leur contenu ?`,'Supprimer',async()=>{let ok=0,failed=0;for(const id of ids){const x=db.cloudItems.find(q=>q.id===id);if(!x)continue;const descendants=new Set([id]);let changed=true;while(changed){changed=false;db.cloudItems.forEach(y=>{if(y.parentId&&descendants.has(y.parentId)&&!descendants.has(y.id)){descendants.add(y.id);changed=true}})}try{if(x.serverName)await api('/api/cloud-delete',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({path:x.serverName})});db.cloudItems=db.cloudItems.filter(y=>!descendants.has(y.id));ok++}catch(e){console.warn(e);failed++}}window.cloudSelectedIds=[];window.cloudSelected='';if(ok)save();render();toast(`${ok} élément(s) supprimé(s)${failed?` · ${failed} échec(s), conservé(s) dans MaClasse`:''}`)})}

function evaluations(){const first=db.classes[0]?.id||'',subjects=gradebookSubjects(first);const st=v101EvaluationStats(first,'');return shell('Évaluations','Carnet de notes','Notes, grilles réutilisables et suivi des compétences.',`<button class="btn primary" onclick="openEvaluation()">+ Nouvelle évaluation</button><button class="btn" onclick="manageEvaluationGrids()">▦ Grilles & compétences</button><button class="btn" onclick="openCompetencyReport()">◉ Bilan compétences</button><button class="btn" onclick="go('activity')">◉ Centre d’activité</button><button class="btn" onclick="exportGradebookCsv()">Exporter CSV</button>`)+`<div class="card"><div class="gradebookToolbar"><div class="field" style="min-width:180px;flex:1"><label>Classe</label><select class="select" id="gradebookClass" onchange="v10GradebookClassChanged()"><option value="">Choisir une classe</option>${db.classes.map(c=>`<option value="${c.id}" ${c.id===first?'selected':''}>${esc(c.name)}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><div class="field" style="min-width:180px;flex:1"><label>Matière</label><select class="select" id="gradebookSubject" onchange="v10RefreshGradebook()"><option value="">Toutes les matières</option>${subjects.map(x=>`<option>${esc(x)}</option>`).join('')}</select></div></div><div id="gradebookSummary" class="section">${gradebookSummary(first,'')}</div><div class="miniKpis section"><div class="miniKpi"><small>Moyenne de classe</small><b>${st.avg} /20</b></div><div class="miniKpi"><small>Plus haute moyenne</small><b>${st.best}</b></div><div class="miniKpi"><small>Plus basse moyenne</small><b>${st.low}</b></div><div class="miniKpi"><small>Évaluations</small><b>${st.es.length}</b></div></div><div id="gradebookMatrix" class="section">${gradebookMatrix(first,'')}</div></div><div class="card section"><div class="sectionhead"><div><h2>Évaluations enregistrées</h2><small class="muted">Ouvrir permet de modifier les métadonnées, les notes et les niveaux de compétences.</small></div></div>${evalList()}</div>`}
function competencySummaryForPeriod(classId,subject='',termId=''){const t=termId?term(termId):null;const es=db.evaluations.filter(e=>e.classId===classId&&(!subject||e.subject===subject)&&(!t||((!t.start||!e.date||e.date>=t.start)&&(!t.end||!e.date||e.date<=t.end))));const names=[...new Set(es.flatMap(e=>Array.isArray(e.competencies)?e.competencies:[]))].sort((a,b)=>a.localeCompare(b,'fr'));return names.map(name=>{const ratings=[];for(const e of es){if(!(e.competencies||[]).includes(name))continue;for(const g of e.grades||[]){const v=Number(g.competencyRatings?.[name]);if(g.studentId&&Number.isFinite(v)&&v>=1&&v<=4)ratings.push({studentId:g.studentId,value:v,date:e.date||''})}}const avg=ratings.length?ratings.reduce((n,r)=>n+r.value,0)/ratings.length:null;return {name,count:ratings.length,average:avg===null?'—':avg.toFixed(2),ratings}})}
function openCompetencyReport(){const first=window.classContext||db.classes[0]?.id||'';openModal('Bilan des compétences',`<div class="searchRow"><div class="field"><label>Classe</label><select id="competencyReportClass" class="select" onchange="refreshCompetencyReport()">${db.classes.map(c=>`<option value="${c.id}" ${c.id===first?'selected':''}>${esc(c.name)}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><div class="field"><label>Matière</label><select id="competencyReportSubject" class="select" onchange="refreshCompetencyReport()"><option value="">Toutes les matières</option>${[...new Set(db.evaluations.map(e=>e.subject).filter(Boolean))].sort((a,b)=>a.localeCompare(b,'fr')).map(x=>`<option>${esc(x)}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><div class="field"><label>Période</label><select id="competencyReportTerm" class="select" onchange="refreshCompetencyReport()"><option value="">Toute l’année</option>${(db.settings.terms||[]).map(t=>`<option value="${t.id}">${esc(t.name)}</option>`).join('')}</select></div></div><div id="competencyReportResults" class="section"></div><div class="modalfoot"><button class="btn" onclick="printCompetencyReport()">Imprimer / PDF</button><button class="btn" onclick="closeModal()">Fermer</button></div>`);refreshCompetencyReport()}
function refreshCompetencyReport(){const root=$('#competencyReportResults');if(!root)return;const cid=$('#competencyReportClass')?.value||'',subject=$('#competencyReportSubject')?.value||'',termId=$('#competencyReportTerm')?.value||'',summary=competencySummaryForPeriod(cid,subject,termId);if(!summary.length){root.innerHTML='<div class="empty">Aucune compétence évaluée pour ces critères. Enregistrez une grille ou des compétences dans une évaluation, puis renseignez les niveaux.</div>';return}const labels={1:'Insuffisant',2:'Fragile',3:'Bien',4:'Très bien'};root.innerHTML=summary.map(c=>{const counts=[1,2,3,4].map(v=>({v,n:c.ratings.filter(r=>r.value===v).length}));const latest=c.ratings.slice().sort((a,b)=>String(b.date).localeCompare(String(a.date))).reduce((acc,r)=>{if(!acc.some(x=>x.studentId===r.studentId))acc.push(r);return acc},[]);return `<div class="card section competencyReportCard"><div class="sectionhead"><div><h3>${esc(c.name)}</h3><small class="muted">${c.count} niveau(x) saisi(s) · Moyenne descriptive : ${c.average}/4</small></div></div><div class="miniKpis">${counts.map(x=>`<div class="miniKpi"><small>${labels[x.v]}</small><b>${x.n}</b></div>`).join('')}</div><div class="tablewrap section"><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>Élève</th><th>Niveau le plus récent</th></tr></thead><tbody>${latest.map(r=>`<tr><td>${esc((student(r.studentId)?.first||'')+' '+(student(r.studentId)?.last||''))}</td><td>${r.value} — ${labels[r.value]}</td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table></div></div>`}).join('')}
function printCompetencyReport(){const root=$('#competencyReportResults');if(!root)return;const w=window.open('','_blank');if(!w)return toast('Autorisez la fenêtre d’impression pour exporter en PDF.');w.document.write('<!doctype html><html lang="fr"><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Bilan des compétences</title><style>body{font:12px Arial;padding:24px;color:#17253a}h1{font-size:22px}h3{margin-bottom:4px}table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:10px 0 20px}td,th{border:1px solid #ccc;padding:6px;text-align:left}.miniKpis{display:flex;gap:10px}.miniKpi{border:1px solid #ddd;padding:7px}</style><h1>Bilan des compétences</h1><p>'+esc($('#competencyReportClass')?.selectedOptions[0]?.textContent||'')+' · '+esc($('#competencyReportSubject')?.value||'Toutes matières')+' · '+esc($('#competencyReportTerm')?.selectedOptions[0]?.textContent||'Toute l’année')+'</p>'+root.innerHTML+'</html>');w.document.close();w.focus();w.print()}
function bulletinCompetencyBlock(b){const summary=competencySummaryForPeriod(b.classId,'',b.termId);if(!summary.length)return '';const labels={1:'Insuffisant',2:'Fragile',3:'Bien',4:'Très bien'};return `<section class="printCompetencies"><h2>Compétences</h2><table><thead><tr><th>Compétence</th><th>Niveau</th></tr></thead><tbody>${summary.map(c=>{const latest=c.ratings.filter(r=>r.studentId===b.studentId).sort((a,z)=>String(z.date).localeCompare(String(a.date)))[0];return `<tr><td>${esc(c.name)}</td><td>${latest?labels[latest.value]||'—':'—'}</td></tr>`}).join('')}</tbody></table><p class="levelLegend">Nomenclature : Très bien · Bien · Fragile · Insuffisant</p></section>`}

function cloudDragStart(e,id){const ids=(window.cloudSelectedIds||[]).includes(id)?window.cloudSelectedIds:[id];e.dataTransfer.setData('text/plain',JSON.stringify(ids));e.dataTransfer.effectAllowed='move';e.currentTarget.classList.add('dragging')}
async function cloudDropTo(e,dest){e.preventDefault();e.stopPropagation();let ids;try{ids=JSON.parse(e.dataTransfer.getData('text/plain'))}catch(_){ids=[e.dataTransfer.getData('text/plain')]}if(!Array.isArray(ids))ids=[ids];for(const id of ids){if(id&&id!==dest)await cloudMove(id,dest)}window.cloudSelectedIds=[];window.cloudSelected='';render()}
async function cloudDrop(e){e.preventDefault();let ids;try{ids=JSON.parse(e.dataTransfer.getData('text/plain'))}catch(_){ids=[e.dataTransfer.getData('text/plain')]}if(!Array.isArray(ids))ids=[ids];const dest=getCloudPath().length?getCloudPath()[getCloudPath().length-1]:null;for(const id of ids)if(id)await cloudMove(id,dest);window.cloudSelectedIds=[];window.cloudSelected='';render()}


